# Evaluator-owned receipts are committed; harness state, workspaces, raw harness logs and per-trial tokens are not.
trials/*/*/*/state/*
trials/*/*/*/workspace/
trials/*/*/*/logs/*
!trials/*/*/*/logs/adapter.log
trials/*/*/*/trial.json
ledger.sqlite-shm
ledger.sqlite-wal
trials/*/*/*/compose.serve.yaml
# The gbrain arm: the sidecar's per-trial token and logs (docs/gbrain-arm.md) stay out of the repository.
trials/*/*/*/gbrain/
# HARN-5 shards: each shard's preflight sidecar scratch (its bootstrap token and sidecar logs) stays out; preflight.log is kept.
*.preflight-gbrain-*/
shards/*/trials/
# HARN-5 verbs run: the shard logs the preregistration names as receipts (proxy, preflight, run-shard, plan, run) are kept despite the root *.log rule.
!/*.log
# HARN-5 installer run: per-trial evidence that the installer's file reached the harness. OpenClaw's turn-1 run record lists
# the workspace files it injected (injectedWorkspaceFiles: AGENTS.md, 1001 chars); Hermes's SOUL.md in its state dir is the
# file it loads, seed plus block. Both are small and carry no token.
!trials/*/*/*/logs/turns/
trials/*/*/*/logs/turns/*
!trials/*/*/*/logs/turns/turn-0001.openclaw.json
!trials/*/*/*/state/hermes/
trials/*/*/*/state/hermes/*
!trials/*/*/*/state/hermes/SOUL.md
# HARN-5 installer-hook run: the per-trial receipts that the harness loaded gbrain's per-turn hook (OpenClaw's plugins inspect
# --runtime --json, Hermes's hooks doctor), small and token-free.
!trials/*/*/*/logs/gbrain-hook.openclaw.json
!trials/*/*/*/logs/gbrain-hook.hermes.log
